## UC01-specific quirks to watch for

- **Silent web browsing**: ChatGPT may browse the web even when not asked (look for "searched the web" indicators). If it does, mark the answer 🌐 in the comparison table.
- **Q14 trap (Activision impairment)**: ChatGPT may pull from training data or news articles instead of the 10-K — verify each cited fact appears in the uploaded file.
- **Q15 over-claim trap**: same risk — model may regurgitate "typical 10-K categories" from priors. Verify it reads the actual Item 1A categories.
- **Model auto-swap**: ChatGPT may downgrade silently between messages on Plus tier. Check the per-message indicator and record any mid-run swaps.
- **Citation style**: varies by model. Record what format is produced (inline numbered, prose, links to docs).

